;; tools/underhum-review.jobs: the Underhum listening page's static recordings (tools/cloudstair-render.sgl).
;; Gains are in-play: the chamber's bed: levels (hum 1.0 air 1.0 water 0 drone 0.7), the drone at its moving
;; level (x 0.35) unless still, the bed ducked 6 dB (0.5) when still or under a moment, the cues at their SPOTS
;; gains, a call at CALL-GAIN x TONE-GAIN (0.32) beside its stone.
